--- text
You are unsubscribed from [LIST_NAME]

[EMAIL_ADDRESS] has been removed from [LIST_NAME]. A message that
was already queued can still reach you during the next
[UNSUB_PROCESSING_PERIOD].

You will still get email about your account itself, if you have
one: receipts, security notices, and replies to messages you send
us.

If you wanted fewer emails rather than none, your email settings
can set the frequency instead:

[SECONDARY_URL]

If [LIST_NAME] email is still arriving after
[UNSUB_PROCESSING_PERIOD], write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL].

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
